{title: Arey Ruk Ja Re Bande}
{artist: Indian Ocean}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Arey ruk jaa... [Ab]arey tham jaa...
[Cm]Arey ruk jaa re bande, [Ab]arey tham jaa re bande...
[Bb]Ki kudrat [Cm]hans padegi ho...
[Cm]Are neendein hai jakhmi, [Ab]are sapne hai bhooke
[Bb]Ki karvat [Cm]phat padegi ho.
[Cm]Arey ruk jaa re bande, [Ab]arey tham jaa re bande...
[Bb]Ki kudrat [Cm]hans padegi ho...
[Cm]Are mandir ye chup hai, [Ab]aray masjid ye gumsum
[Bb]Ibadat thak [Cm]padegi ho.
[Cm]Samay ki lal aandhi, [Ab]kabristan ke raaste
[Bb]Are latpath [Cm]chalegi ho.
[Cm]Kise kafir kahega [Ab]kise kayar kahega
[Bb]Teri kab [Cm]tak chalegi ho.
[Cm]Kise kafir kahega [Ab]kise kayar kahega
[Bb]Teri kab [Cm]tak chalegi ho.
[Cm]Are mandir ye chup [Ab]hai are masjid hai gumsum
[Bb]Ibadat thak [Cm]padegi ho.
[Cm]Samay ki lal [Ab]aandhi kabristan ke raste
[Bb]Are latpath [Cm]chalegi ho.
[Cm]Are neendein hai jakhmi [Ab]are sapne hai bhooke
[Bb]Ki karvat [Cm]phat padegi ho.
[Cm]Yeh andhi chot teri [Ab]kabhi ki sukh jaati
[Bb]Magar ab [Cm]pak chalegi.
